/Title (HiSE investigates this through five coordinated mechanisms: multi-dimensional structural addressing in pre-attention embedding space, structure-guided attention during fine-tuning, POMDP-grounded theoretical formalization of structural observability, contrastive training with structurally-adversarial hard negatives. HiSE demonstrates that structural geometry is encodable in vector space at the embedding level. The context window problem is solvable from this direction.)
